@startuml runtime
title CleanArchTemplate — runtime topology

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"

actor Client
node "api\n(stateless, scale to N)" as Api
node "worker\noutbox drain + consumers" as Worker
node "migrator\nrun to completion" as Migrator

database "postgres 18\naggregates + outbox" as Pg
database "redis\ncache · stamps · claims" as Redis
queue "redpanda (kafka)" as Kafka
node "mailpit / SMTP" as Smtp

Client --> Api : HTTPS
Api --> Pg : read / write
Api --> Redis : cache, security stamps,\nlogin throttling

Migrator --> Pg : migrations, admin seed
Migrator --> Kafka : create topics

Worker --> Pg : poll outbox\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
Worker --> Kafka : publish + consume
Worker --> Redis : email idempotency claims
Worker --> Smtp : deliver

note right of Migrator
  Runs to completion before api and
  worker start. A single writer, whatever
  the replica count.
end note

note bottom of Worker
  Publishing is kept off the request path,
  and scales on message volume rather than
  on request volume.
end note

@enduml
